---
<section id="Stakes" class="section-wrapper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-container">
      <h1 class="section-header">Don't Let Outdated Technology Hold You Back</h1>
      <p class="text-enhanced mb-md">Are inefficient tools causing frustration and lost opportunities?</p>
      <p class="mb-md leading-normal">Our team of experts specializes in modern frameworks and technologies to deliver high-performance, scalable solutions that drive business success. We combine strategic thinking with technical excellence to create digital solutions that transform how our clients operate.</p>
      
      <div class="mt-lg">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-md max-w-full mx-auto">
          <!-- Card components with consistent styling using global card class -->
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Too many choices that confuse your team</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Missing growth opportunities due to outdated systems</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Wasting time on ineffective software solutions</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Feeling overwhelmed by complex technology decisions</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Staying behind competitors in tech advancement</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Fearing you cannot scale your operations effectively</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Increased stress from management inefficiencies</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Financial loss from missed tech investments</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="text-md leading-normal m-0">Struggling with disconnected tools that don't talk to each other</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-xl flex justify-center">
        <button 
          class="btn btn-primary"
          data-cal-link="guavatt/30min"
          data-cal-namespace="30min"
          data-cal-config='{"layout":"month_view","theme":"light"}'
        >
          Schedule a Call
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>